Part A. Exact symbolic checks
====================================================================================================
A1. symbol of U: (xi1 xi2, -xi1^2)/|xi|^2 = [xi1*xi2/(xi1**2 + xi2**2), -xi1**2/(xi1**2 + xi2**2)] ; principal symbol of U[.].D rho on |xi| = 1: rho_x*xi1*xi2 - rho_y*xi1**2 ; xi^T M0 xi = rho_x*xi1*xi2 - rho_y*xi1**2 ; equal: True
A2. eigenvalues of M = b I + M0: [b - rho_y/2 - sqrt(rho_x**2 + rho_y**2)/2, b - rho_y/2 + sqrt(rho_x**2 + rho_y**2)/2] ; largest equals b + (|D rho| - rho_y)/2: True
A3. M(S_x X) - S_x M S_x = [0, 0, 0, 0] ; M(S_y X) - S_y M S_y = [0, 0, 0, 0]
A4. d_1^2 d_2 (log r/(2 pi)) - sin(3 theta)/(pi r^3) = 0 ; kernel odd under X -> -X, and U2 = R1^2 = -d_1^2 Lap^-1, so d_y U2[h](0) = (1/pi) int sin(3 theta) h r^-3 dX
A5. b = -V.D log w_R - a (V.X)/(R^2 + r^2) = 0

